    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "oh i didn't know that. i read online that vitamin c is a huge antioxidant and helps clean out toxins. i'm just worried that if i don't do something aggressive i'm gonna get another one soon. do you think there's any way to take it that wouldn't be risky? like maybe just split the dose or take it with something else to make sure it doesn't turn into oxalate?",
