      "content": "i get what you're saying but i'm really not a fan of my doctor's approach, they always just tell me to drink more water and don't really help with the actual detoxing part. \n\nif i were to just take a really large dose once every few days instead of every day, would that be okay? i feel like my body needs that big hit of antioxidants to really clear everything out. would that be a safer way to get the benefits without the oxalate issue building up?",
